{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15247","headline":"和丘员外题湛长史旧居 · 李益","name":"和丘员外题湛长史旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔降英王顾。\n屏身幽岩曲，灵波结繁笳。\n爽籁赴鸣玉，运转春华至。\n岁来山草绿，青松掩落晖。\n白云竟空谷，伊人抚遗叹。\n恻恻芳又缛，云谁斅美香。\n分毫寄明牧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15247.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15247","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}